&_nc_oc=AdpRgliBG8wcqdDKrKPm40UhctgytRVgFiOg_RiHrLTeCuLRsKtJyMN77F5qG4df8mQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0KnOZnH7fzD93h93x4-ll1Oc1WeTeAQ2IH6Bsa03QA6w&oe=69E75C7E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2fUpWt8FwFMQ7kNvwFJbkW8&_nc_oc=AdqILLW3LaixRNa5Vp7ka4EtSi9qq3afMsa9wGtiefogRp8zpHnfSuaVq-iCE1E89SE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3POhWtYypOvOfuhoVqHMUUNG5CFn2QmgwFjRffDY44IQ&oe=69E76D7C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-isJm9PYcdAQ7kNvwEM2HZS&_nc_oc=AdotdOhBesHhByDJCwcgK1eH95jntUjEEvmskPIeVTfOFN1KhpoiBjyCvv0Rfdw8V40&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0SNWfUhSoGibociqtmWGZqr0F2Kr687ltSI4zm9dEMYw&oe=69E78C07"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ynw_DJLA6voQ7kNvwGur0gx&_nc_oc=AdoDJTlwjQy370FSTHyoeyUTQYx30laQkEJuCpHiDkEziX43rwiZU_Xsjs5PC8mqzM4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0-1rrFwC9bDIkUTSrb52IBPimoUFCJD73hEe3O4AyEuQ&oe=69E777D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gzIee2xhjzcQ7kNvwGKItyr&_nc_oc=AdpAJLLh78_d-yLG20dk5dmJCVCJBBzyRLCqM-LYYXMHD16IVirReCPPWTsKCAwjBps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3jnJ6czg_bwlaUR8LLxgvCszFEqFgsGhFLJ1um7lM99w&oe=69E78464"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.